{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-debug-flow-idor",
    "name": "debug-flow 水平越权测试（catalog）",
    "description": "按真实业务测 GET /debug-flow/catalog 水平越权（BOLA）。\n\n步骤：\n1. 登录拿 Bearer\n2. 开 session A / B，记下两套 accountId + sessionToken\n3. 基准：A 的 token + A 的 accountId\n4. 越权：A 的 sessionToken + B 的 accountId\n5. 看状态码与响应里 data.catalog.accountId\n\n导入后先改 Collection Variables：baseUrl、loginUsername、loginPassword。\n按文件夹顺序 Execute，或用 Collection Runner 顺序跑。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:3000/api" },
    { "key": "loginUsername", "value": "admin" },
    { "key": "loginPassword", "value": "改成你的密码" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "flowSessionTokenA", "value": "" },
    { "key": "flowAccountIdA", "value": "" },
    { "key": "flowSessionTokenB", "value": "" },
    { "key": "flowAccountIdB", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. 准备",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0.1 登录拿 Bearer",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('登录成功 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('返回 token', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "if (json.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('token 已写入 collection variable');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{loginUsername}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{loginPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "description": "平台登录。成功后自动把 token 存到集合变量。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "0.2 清空 debug-flow 内存态（可选）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('reset 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/debug-flow/reset",
            "description": "可选。清空内存会话，避免旧 session 干扰。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. 准备两个业务账号（session A / B）",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 开 session A → accountId_A",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('session A 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const token = json?.result?.auth?.session?.token;",
                  "const accountId = json?.result?.auth?.account?.id;",
                  "pm.test('抽出 sessionToken / accountId', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "    pm.expect(accountId).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('flowSessionTokenA', token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('flowAccountIdA', accountId);",
                  "console.log('A:', accountId, token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"actor\": \"user-A\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/debug-flow/session",
            "description": "业务身份 A。抽取：\n- $.result.auth.session.token → flowSessionTokenA\n- $.result.auth.account.id → flowAccountIdA"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 开 session B → accountId_B",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('session B 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const token = json?.result?.auth?.session?.token;",
                  "const accountId = json?.result?.auth?.account?.id;",
                  "pm.test('抽出 sessionToken / accountId', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "    pm.expect(accountId).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('A/B accountId 必须不同', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(accountId).to.not.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('flowAccountIdA'));",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('flowSessionTokenB', token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('flowAccountIdB', accountId);",
                  "console.log('B:', accountId, token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"actor\": \"user-B\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/debug-flow/session",
            "description": "业务身份 B。抽取 flowSessionTokenB / flowAccountIdB。\n注意：这里的 accountId 是 debug-flow 会话账号，不是平台登录名。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. 越权验证 GET /debug-flow/catalog",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 基准：A 的 session + A 的 accountId（应成功）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const accA = pm.collectionVariables.get('flowAccountIdA');",
                  "pm.test('基准应 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('code=0', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(0);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('响应 accountId 等于 A', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(json?.data?.catalog?.accountId).to.eql(accA);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('有商品列表（建立可读基准）', function () {",
                  "    const products = json?.data?.catalog?.groups?.[0]?.products;",
                  "    pm.expect(products).to.be.an('array').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "console.log('基准 OK，accountId=', json?.data?.catalog?.accountId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/debug-flow/catalog?accountId={{flowAccountIdA}}&sessionToken={{flowSessionTokenA}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["debug-flow", "catalog"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "accountId", "value": "{{flowAccountIdA}}" },
                { "key": "sessionToken", "value": "{{flowSessionTokenA}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "正向基准：当前用户查自己的 accountId，应 200。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 越权：A 的 session + B 的 accountId（真实业务应拒绝）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const status = pm.response.code;",
                  "const accA = pm.collectionVariables.get('flowAccountIdA');",
                  "const accB = pm.collectionVariables.get('flowAccountIdB');",
                  "const respAcc = json?.data?.catalog?.accountId;",
                  "const products = json?.data?.catalog?.groups?.[0]?.products;",
                  "",
                  "console.log('越权请求: sessionToken=A, accountId=B(' + accB + ')');",
                  "console.log('实际 status=', status, ' resp.accountId=', respAcc);",
                  "",
                  "// 按「真实业务」期望：应拒绝（403/401/400）或至少不能读到 B 的数据",
                  "// 当前 debug-flow 实现会 200 且回显 B → 水平越权成立",
                  "const rejected = status === 401 || status === 403 || status === 400;",
                  "const leakedB = status === 200 && respAcc === accB && Array.isArray(products) && products.length > 0;",
                  "",
                  "if (rejected) {",
                  "    pm.test('[安全通过] 已拒绝跨 accountId 访问', function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(rejected).to.be.true;",
                  "    });",
                  "} else if (leakedB) {",
                  "    // 故意用失败断言标出漏洞，方便在 Runner 里一眼看到红",
                  "    pm.test('[漏洞成立] 水平越权：A 会话可读 B 的 accountId 数据', function () {",
                  "        pm.expect.fail(",
                  "            '水平越权成立：仍返回 200，且 data.catalog.accountId=' + respAcc +",
                  "            '（B=' + accB + '）。真实业务应 403/401 或空数据，不能读到 B。'",
                  "        );",
                  "    });",
                  "} else {",
                  "    pm.test('结果需人工确认（非典型拒绝也非典型泄露）', function () {",
                  "        pm.expect.fail('status=' + status + ' resp.accountId=' + respAcc + ' body=' + pm.response.text().slice(0, 300));",
                  "    });",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "// 提缺陷时复制 Console / 下面信息",
                  "pm.test('缺陷记录信息（始终打印）', function () {",
                  "    const note = {",
                  "        url: pm.request.url.toString(),",
                  "        sessionTokenOwner: 'A',",
                  "        accountIdA: accA,",
                  "        accountIdB: accB,",
                  "        status: status,",
                  "        responseAccountId: respAcc,",
                  "        conclusion: leakedB ? '水平越权成立' : (rejected ? '已拒绝' : '待确认')",
                  "    };",
                  "    console.log(JSON.stringify(note, null, 2));",
                  "    pm.expect(true).to.be.true;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/debug-flow/catalog?accountId={{flowAccountIdB}}&sessionToken={{flowSessionTokenA}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["debug-flow", "catalog"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "accountId", "value": "{{flowAccountIdB}}" },
                { "key": "sessionToken", "value": "{{flowSessionTokenA}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "关键越权用例：\n- 保持 A 的 sessionToken\n- 只把 Query accountId 改成 B\n\n真实业务期望：403/401/400，或空列表。\n若仍 200 且 data.catalog.accountId=B → 水平越权成立。\n\n本请求的 Tests 会在漏洞成立时故意 fail，方便 Runner 标红。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.3 对照：B 的 session + B 的 accountId（应成功）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const accB = pm.collectionVariables.get('flowAccountIdB');",
                  "pm.test('B 查自己应 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('响应 accountId 等于 B', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(json?.data?.catalog?.accountId).to.eql(accB);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/debug-flow/catalog?accountId={{flowAccountIdB}}&sessionToken={{flowSessionTokenB}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["debug-flow", "catalog"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "accountId", "value": "{{flowAccountIdB}}" },
                { "key": "sessionToken", "value": "{{flowSessionTokenB}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "对照：B 查自己应成功，证明 B 的身份本身有效，问题出在「跨 accountId」。"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
